sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant A as Application API
    participant D as Database/Session Store
    B->>A: POST /auth/login (credentials over HTTPS)
    A->>D: Find account
    D-->>A: Account + password hash
    A->>A: Verify password
    A->>D: Create server-side session
    D-->>A: Session stored
    A-->>B: Set-Cookie (HttpOnly, Secure in production, SameSite)
    B->>A: GET /auth/me + eligible cookie
    A->>D: Validate/load session
    D-->>A: Session + user ID
    A-->>B: User profile (never password hash)
    B->>A: POST /auth/logout
    A->>D: Invalidate session
    A-->>B: Clear cookie + success
